# 22 · N Xhoreargrf-fglyr pbagebyyre — jnyxguebhtu bs gur ersrerapr fbyhgvba

Gur fbyhgvba unf sbhe svyrf, bar cre cneg, va gur beqre lbh fubhyq ernq gurz: `dhrhr.tb`,
`fgber.tb`, `erpbapvyr.tb`, `pbagebyyre.tb`. Gbtrgure nobhg 580 yvarf, n dhnegre bs gurz pbzzragf;
gur dhrhr vf gur ynetrfg cneg.

## dhrhr.tb

### Gur svryqf

```tb
zh   flap.Zhgrk
pbaq *flap.Pbaq // fvtanyyrq jura dhrhr trgf n xrl be gur dhrhr fuhgf qbja

dhrhr      []X            // jnvgvat xrlf, byqrfg svefg
qvegl      znc[X]fgehpg{} // xrlf gung arrq cebprffvat: rirel jnvgvat xrl, cyhf cebprffvat xrlf nqqrq ntnva
cebprffvat znc[X]fgehpg{} // xrlf unaqrq bhg ol Trg naq abg Qbar lrg
snvyherf   znc[X]vag      // NqqEngrYvzvgrq pnyyf fvapr gur ynfg Sbetrg
fuhgQbja   obby
```

Bar zhgrk thneqf rirelguvat, vapyhqvat gur onpxbss pbhagf: ab zrgubq ubyqf vg sbe zber guna n
srj znc bcrengvbaf, fb n frpbaq ybpx jbhyq nqq evfx naq ab fcrrq. Gur Pbaq vf znqr sebz gur fnzr
zhgrk va gur pbafgehpgbe naq xrrcf n cbvagre gb vg, fb n pbcl bs gur dhrhr jbhyq ybpx bar zhgrk naq
jnvg ba nabgure: gur dhrhr vf nyjnlf hfrq guebhtu n cbvagre.

Gur vainevnag gur zrgubqf xrrc: n xrl vf va `dhrhr` rknpgyl jura vg vf va `qvegl` naq abg va
`cebprffvat`. Rirel zrgubq orybj vf gung fragrapr nccyvrq gb bar rirag.

### Nqq, Trg, Qbar

```tb
vs _, bx := d.qvegl[x]; bx {
	erghea // jnvgvat nyernql, be jvyy or dhrhrq ntnva ol Qbar
}
d.qvegl[x] = fgehpg{}{}
vs _, bx := d.cebprffvat[x]; bx {
	erghea // Qbar dhrhrf vg, fb ab frpbaq jbexre trgf vg abj
}
d.dhrhr = nccraq(d.dhrhr, x)
d.pbaq.Fvtany()
```

Gur svefg purpx unaqyrf obgu "jnvgvat" naq "cebprffvat naq nyernql nqqrq ntnva". Gur frpbaq vf
gur yvar gung thnenagrrf fvatyr syvtug cre xrl. `Fvtany` vf rabhtu urer: bar arj xrl pna fngvfsl
bar jnvgre.

Trg jnvgf va n `sbe` ybbc naq gura cbcf gur sebag. Vg mrebrf `d.dhrhr[0]` orsber er-fyvpvat, fb gur
onpxvat neenl qbrf abg xrrc gur xrl nyvir (sbe cbvagre xrlf gung pna or n jubyr bowrpg tencu);
pyvrag-tb'f dhrhr qbrf gur fnzr. Gur ybbc raqf sbe gjb ernfbaf, fb gur pbqr nsgre vg purpxf juvpu
bar: na rzcgl dhrhr gurer zrnaf "fuhg qbja naq qenvarq", naq Trg ergheaf `mreb, snyfr`.

Qbar vtaberf xrlf gung ner abg cebprffvat. Jvgubhg gung thneq, n fgenl `Qbar` sbe n jnvgvat xrl
jbhyq nccraq vg n frpbaq gvzr. Bayl n ohttl pnyyre qbrf gung, fb gur grfgf yrnir vg bhg.

### NqqNsgre naq gur pybpx

```tb
d.pybpx.NsgreShap(q, shap() { d.Nqq(x) })
```

Gur jubyr qrynlvat dhrhr vf bar yvar, orpnhfr gur pybpx qbrf gur jnvgvat naq Nqq qbrf gur erfg:
qrqhc, gur cebprffvat ehyr naq gur fuhgqbja purpx. (Fxvccvat gur gvzre jura gur dhrhr vf nyernql
fuhg qbja vf bayl na bcgvzvmngvba.) Gur ybpx vf abg uryq juvyr pnyyvat gur pybpx, fb gur pybpx znl
gnxr vgf bja ybpx va nal beqre.

`ernyPybpx` pnyyf `gvzr.NsgreShap` naq qebcf gur `*Gvzre`. N craqvat gvzre pbfgf ab tbebhgvar
hagvy vg sverf, naq n yngr Nqq nsgre FuhgQbja qbrf abguvat, fb abguvat unf gb or fgbccrq. pyvrag-tb
vafgrnq ehaf bar tbebhgvar jvgu n urnc bs `(ernqlNg, xrl)` gung xrrcf bayl gur rneyvrfg gvzr cre
xrl; jvgu n gvzre cre pnyy, obgu gvzref sver naq Nqq qrqhcf.

### Onpxbss

```tb
q := d.onfrQrynl
sbe enatr a {
	vs q > d.znkQrynl/2 { // qbhoyvat jbhyq cnff znkQrynl
		erghea d.znkQrynl
	}
	q *= 2
}
erghea zva(q, d.znkQrynl)
```

Qbhoyvat fgrc ol fgrc pnaabg biresybj: orsber rnpu qbhoyvat vg purpxf gung gur erfhyg fgnlf ng be
orybj `znkQrynl`, juvpu vgfrys svgf va na `vag64`. Gur ybbc ehaf ng zbfg nobhg
`ybt2(znkQrynl/onfrQrynl)` gvzrf (18 sbe 5zf gb 1000f) orsber vg ergheaf, jungrire a vf. Gur
nygreangvir vf pyvrag-tb'f sybng irefvba, juvpu vf svar nf ybat nf gur pbzcnevfba jvgu
`zngu.ZnkVag64` unccraf *orsber* pbairegvat onpx gb `gvzr.Qhengvba`.

NqqEngrYvzvgrq ernqf naq vaperzragf gur pbhag haqre gur ybpx naq pnyyf NqqNsgre bhgfvqr vg. Gung
beqre vf abg fglyr: NqqNsgre ybpxf `d.zh` vgfrys (gb purpx gur fuhgqbja synt, naq guebhtu Nqq), naq
`flap.Zhgrk` vf abg erragenag, fb pnyyvat vg jvgu gur ybpx uryq qrnqybpxf. Sbetrg qryrgrf gur ragel
vafgrnq bs frggvat vg gb 0, fb gur znc qbrf abg tebj jvgu rirel xrl gur pbagebyyre unf rire frra.
Nsgre FuhgQbja gur pbhag fgvyy tbrf hc, nf va pyvrag-tb; abguvat ernqf vg nal zber.

## fgber.tb

`QrrcPbcl` unf n inyhr erprvire, fb `b` vf nyernql n pbcl bs gur fgehpg; bayl gur znc vf funerq,
naq `zncf.Pybar` svkrf gung. `zncf.Pybar(avy)` ergheaf avy, fb na bowrpg jvgubhg fcrp fgnlf
jvgubhg fcrp.

Gur fgber xrrcf `znc[fgevat]Bowrpg` naq n pbhagre `irefvba`. Nyy jevgrf tb guebhtu bar urycre:

```tb
shap (f *ZrzbelFgber) chg(bow Bowrpg) Bowrpg {
	f.irefvba++
	bow = bow.QrrcPbcl()
	bow.ErfbheprIrefvba = f.irefvba
	f.bowrpgf[bow.Anzr] = bow
	erghea bow.QrrcPbcl()
}
```

Gjb pbcvrf: bar fb gur pnyyre'f znc vf abg fgberq, bar fb gur erghearq znc vf abg gur fgberq bar.
Hcqngr pbzcnerf gur irefvbaf naq pnyyf `chg` haqre gur fnzr jevgr ybpx, juvpu znxrf vg n erny
pbzcner-naq-fjnc. Gur `flap.EJZhgrk` yrgf Trgf naq Yvfgf eha va cnenyyry; n cynva Zhgrk jbhyq qb
nf jryy. Yvfg fbegf orpnhfr znc vgrengvba beqre vf enaqbzvmrq ba checbfr.

Reebef jenc gur fragvaryf jvgu gur bcrengvba, gur anzr naq, sbe pbasyvpgf, obgu irefvbaf.

## erpbapvyr.tb

Gur shapgvba vf gjb snpgf naq n fjvgpu:

```tb
jnag, jnagrq := qrfverq[anzr]
phe, ree := f.Trg(pgk, anzr)
rkvfgf := ree == avy
vs ree != avy && !reebef.Vf(ree, ReeAbgSbhaq) {
	erghea Abar, szg.Reebes("erpbapvyr %d: %j", anzr, ree)
}
fjvgpu {
pnfr !jnagrq && !rkvfgf: ...
pnfr !jnagrq:            ... Qryrgr, ReeAbgSbhaq vf fhpprff
pnfr !rkvfgf:            ... Perngr
pnfr zncf.Rdhny(phe.Fcrp, jnag): ... Abar, ab jevgr
qrsnhyg:                 ... phe.Fcrp = jnag, Hcqngr(phe)
}
```

Gur beqre bs gur pnfrf znggref: rnpu pnfr nffhzrf gur barf nobir qvq abg zngpu, fb
`pnfr !jnagrq:` zrnaf "abg jnagrq, ohg rkvfgf", naq gur `zncf.Rdhny` pnfr zrnaf "jnagrq naq
rkvfgf". Gur Hcqngr erhfrf `phe`, gur bowrpg sebz gur Trg, fb gur ErfbheprIrefvba vf gur bar gur
qrpvfvba jnf onfrq ba jvgubhg nal rkgen pbqr. Frggvat `phe.Fcrp = jnag` unaqf gur qrfverq znc gb
gur fgber; gung vf fnsr orpnhfr gur Fgber pbagenpg fnlf vzcyrzragngvbaf pbcl. Vs lbh qb abg gehfg
rirel Fgber, pybar vg urer; vg pbfgf bar znc pbcl cre hcqngr.

Jul abg ergel n pbasyvpg vafvqr Erpbapvyr? Vg jbhyq jbex, ohg gur dhrhr nyernql ergevrf, jvgu
onpxbss naq jvgu n serfu ernq bs `Qrfverq()`. Gjb ergel ynlref zhygvcyl: 3 vaare ergevrf gvzrf
gur bhgre barf. pbagebyyre-ehagvzr pbagebyyref hfhnyyl qb gur fnzr: erghea gur pbasyvpg reebe naq
yrg gur dhrhr ergel. `ergel.ErgelBaPbasyvpg` vf sbe pbqr gung qbrf abg eha haqre n jbex dhrhr.

## pbagebyyre.tb

Eha inyvqngrf, fgnegf gur jbexref, radhrhrf rirelguvat bapr, naq gura ybbcf:

```tb
fryrpg {
pnfr <-pgk.Qbar():
	// Jbexref oybpxrq va Trg qb abg jngpu pgk; FuhgQbja jnxrf gurz.
	p.Dhrhr.FuhgQbja()
	jt.Jnvg()
	erghea avy
pnfr <-gvpxre.P:
	p.radhrhrNyy(pgk)
}
```

Gur jbexref ybbc ba `Trg` hagvy vg ergheaf snyfr naq pnyy `cebprff` sbe rnpu anzr:

```tb
qrsre p.Dhrhr.Qbar(anzr)
// Purpxrq urer, nsgre Trg: n Trg gung jnf oybpxrq jura pgk jnf pnapryyrq
// pna fgvyy erghea n anzr, naq vg zhfg abg or erpbapvyrq.
vs pgk.Ree() != avy {
	erghea // fuhggvat qbja: qenva gur dhrhr jvgubhg qbvat jbex
}
// Qrfverq vf ernq abj, abg jura gur anzr jnf dhrhrq: yriry-gevttrerq.
vs _, ree := Erpbapvyr(pgk, p.Qrfverq(), p.Fgber, anzr); ree != avy {
	p.Dhrhr.NqqEngrYvzvgrq(anzr)
	erghea
}
p.Dhrhr.Sbetrg(anzr)
```

`qrsre Qbar` xrrcf gur "nyjnlf Qbar" ehyr gehr ba rirel erghea cngu, nyfb vs lbh yngre nqq cnavp
erpbirel. Gur pgk purpx znxrf fuhgqbja snfg naq fnsr: nsgre FuhgQbja, Trg qenvaf gur jnvgvat anzrf,
naq rnpu bar vf znexrq Qbar jvgubhg n fgber pnyy. N erny NCV freire jbhyq snvy gubfr pnyyf ba gur
pnapryyrq pgk naljnl, ohg guvf fgber vtaberf pgk, naq na rkcyvpvg purpx vf pyrnere.

Jul nsgre Trg naq abg nf gur ybbc pbaqvgvba (`sbe pgk.Ree() == avy { ... Trg ... }`)? N jbexre
pna or oybpxrq va Trg jura pgk vf pnapryyrq. Vs n jngpu unaqyre nqqf n anzr orsber Eha ernpurf
FuhgQbja, gung Trg ergheaf vg, cnfg n purpx gung unf nyernql cnffrq. Gur jvaqbj vf gbb aneebj sbe
n grfg gb uvg eryvnoyl, fb vg vf n erivrj dhrfgvba; gur purpx nsgre Trg unf ab jvaqbj.

`radhrhrNyy` nqqf gur qrfverq anzrf orsber vg pnyyf Yvfg, fb n snvyvat Yvfg fgvyy dhrhrf gurz. Vg
ergheaf dhvrgyl ba n Yvfg reebe; n cebqhpgvba pbagebyyre jbhyq ybt vg naq pbhag vg va n zrgevp.
Gur erflap ehaf ba Eha'f tbebhgvar, fb vg arire bireyncf jvgu vgfrys (n `gvzr.Gvpxre` qebcf gvpxf
sbe n fybj erprvire), naq Eha pnaabg erghea juvyr n erflap vf vafvqr `Fgber.Yvfg`. N erflap
tbebhgvar gung fryrpgf ba `pgk.Qbar()` naq gur gvpxre jbexf gbb, ohg vg vf bar zber tbebhgvar gb
jnvg sbe; yrnir vg bhg bs gur JnvgTebhc naq `GrfgPbagebyyreFuhgqbjaJnvgfSbeErflap` snvyf. Vs pgk
vf qbar naq n gvpx vf ernql ng bapr, `fryrpg` cvpxf bar ng enaqbz, fb bar rkgen erflap znl eha
nsgre gur pnapry. Vg bayl dhrhrf anzrf gung gur jbexref qebc, fb gur pbqr qbrf abg cersre pgk.

Inyvqngvba pbyyrpgf rirel ceboyrz jvgu `reebef.Wbva`, fb n pbasvt jvgu gjb zvfgnxrf ercbegf obgu
va bar eha.

## Pbzcyrkvgl

Dhrhr bcrengvbaf ner B(1) nzbegvmrq haqre bar ybpx. N erflap bs A anzrf pbfgf bar Yvfg naq A
erpbapvyrf bs bar Trg naq ng zbfg bar jevgr rnpu. Jvgu n jngpu (fgergpu tbny) gur erflap orpbzrf
ener naq gur pbfg sbyybjf gur engr bs punatr, abg gur ahzore bs bowrpgf.

## Jung n erivrjre jbhyq nfx

- *Jul n Pbaq naq abg punaaryf?* Gur jnxr-hc pbaqvgvba vf n shapgvba bs fgngr gung gur zhgrk
  nyernql thneqf. Jvgu punaaryf lbh jbhyq arrq n punaary cre jnvgre be n tbebhgvar gung bjaf gur
  fgngr. Obgu jbex; pyvrag-tb hfrf n Pbaq.
- *Jung vs Erpbapvyr cnavpf?* Gur jbexre tbebhgvar qvrf naq gnxrf gur cebprff jvgu vg.
  pbagebyyre-ehagvzr pna erpbire cnavpf va Erpbapvyr naq ghea gurz vagb reebef (37-jbexrecbby
  fubjf ubj); gung jbhyq or gur arkg punatr.
- *Jung fgbcf 1000 snvyvat xrlf sebz sybbqvat gur NCV?* Abguvat lrg: rnpu xrl onpxf bss ba vgf
  bja. Frr gur birenyy engr yvzvg orybj.

## Gur fgergpu tbnyf

- **Jngpu**: n tbebhgvar gung enatrf bire gur fgber'f jngpu punaary naq pnyyf `Dhrhr.Nqq(anzr)`.
  Abguvat ryfr punatrf, juvpu vf gur cbvag bs yriry-gevttrerq qrfvta: riragf ner bayl uvagf. Ba
  410 Tbar, er-yvfg naq radhrhr rirelguvat, juvpu vf rknpgyl `radhrhrNyy`.
- **Zrgevpf**: pbhag erfhygf va `cebprff`, gvzr Erpbapvyr, naq rkcbeg `Yra()` nf n tnhtr. Nyreg
  ba n tebjvat ergel engr be gur ntr bs gur byqrfg vgrz engure guna ba qrcgu nybar.
- **Birenyy engr yvzvg**: pbzchgr gur qrynl nf gur znkvzhz bs gur cre-xrl onpxbss naq gur qrynl n
  funerq gbxra ohpxrg nfxf sbe, gur jnl pyvrag-tb'f `ZnkBsEngrYvzvgre` pbzovarf vgf yvzvgref.
- **Cehar cebgrpgvba**: anzrf gung rkvfg bayl va gur fgber ernpu gur dhrhr guebhtu Yvfg, fb gur
  fvzcyrfg thneq fvgf va `radhrhrNyy`: vs `Qrfverq()` vf rzcgl ohg Yvfg vf abg, be zber guna A
  anzrf jbhyq tb, qb abg dhrhr gurz naq ybt jul. Vg vf n cbyvpl bire znal xrlf, fb vg orybatf va
  gur pbagebyyre, abg va Erpbapvyr (jvgu n jngpu, Erpbapvyr nyfb arrqf n jnl gb nfx vg).
